Portions of src/index.ts are derived from the in-tree Mastra server adapters,
principally @mastra/elysia (server-adapters/elysia). The behaviour carried over
includes the stream framing for both SSE and record-separated formats, the
error-swallowing forwarding stream, the stripping of Transfer-Encoding from a
forwarded response, the structure of the responseType dispatch, and the decision
not to await the MCP transport start call. Further portions follow @mastra/hono
(server-adapters/hono): propagating a client disconnect to an MCP transport
(from its mcp-disconnect.ts), carrying the caller's auth into MCP transports,
answering a failed MCP transport start with a server error, closing a stream
that fails partway, reading every value of a repeated query key, reading the
requestContext query parameter on POST, and passing an error's failingItems
through. Those portions remain under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

This package depends on Effect (https://github.com/Effect-TS/effect), which is
